{"id":201863166170233,"type":"artist","name":"Eyehategod","artist":null,"year":1988,"weight":11,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1988","kind":"Group","similar":["Buzzov•en","Crowbar","Soilent Green","Grief","Acid Bath","Iron Monkey","Weedeater","Electric Wizard","Dystopia","Bongzilla"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/HF2022EyeHateGod_3.jpg?width=500","bio":"Hacia finales de los 80 cinco fumetas \"degenerados\" de Louissiana se juntaron y, mientras la mayoría de los grupos de aquel sitio entonces hacían thrash metal clásico, estos se empeñaban en tocar lo más alto y más lento que pudieran. Había nacido uno de los grupos más intensos y \"trastornados\" de la década, EYEHATEGOD. Desde entonces, nos han ofrecido cuatro joyas, y unos cuantos LP's, 7\" y EP's, que tienen el honor de ser las obras del Metal y Hardcore más intensas y llenas de sentimiento que","tags":["Sludge","doom metal","sludge metal","sludgecore","metal"]},"works":[{"id":45652273173749,"type":"album","name":"In the Name of Suffering","artist":"Eyehategod","year":1990,"weight":18,"yt":"GyjvUfz73MU","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":668,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":51579086227886,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — NOLA Sludge","rank":10,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":221505587927745,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Sludge Metal","rank":70,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":232021590805268,"type":"album","name":"Take as Needed for Pain","artist":"Eyehategod","year":1993,"weight":10,"yt":"OBR5lFCrAXE","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":59251635065665,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993","rank":71,"scaruffi":null},{"id":51579086227886,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — NOLA Sludge","rank":6,"scaruffi":null},{"id":221505587927745,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Sludge Metal","rank":20,"scaruffi":nul